# H-NR1 A/B for D-INODE-CLUSTER-PUBLISH-WITHOUT-AUTHORITY, shape (d), on
# 3/disk/caw/direct g3 (test1 test2 test3), fw3c3's configuration.  Same build
# for both arms: ~/src/mxfs-f srcversion 69A9ED8E639EB2D21B613A6, the final
# verification build 022F8BF6763B609A9ECC7D1 (~/src/mxfs-e) plus the H-NR1 fix
# and its instrument and nothing else (xfs/xfs_icache.c, xfs/xfs_icache.h,
# xfs/xfs_inode.h, xfs/xfs_mxfs_dir_data.c, xfs/xfs_mxfs_dlm.c,
# xfs/xfs_mxfs_noino.c, pal/linux/xfs_buf.c).  A no-inode release whose unlock
# leaves a grant cached by an in-core inode of the number marks that inode
# (both settings).  With module knob noino_release_mark_honor=1 the recycle
# that finds the mark ends that tenure: the epoch moves and i_dlm_stale is set,
# the mode drops to what the DLM records (NL when the record cannot be read)
# or, when the DLM records a grant at least as strong (a create's reservation
# took it again), stays; 0 is the same-build control, which keeps the tenure as
# before.  A cluster write names every slot it carries with bytes copied in
# before such a recycle (P-LOGWR-RELMARK-WRITTEN, both settings).  Run from
# ~/src/mxfs-f.  Every other setting is exactly
# tests/queues/final_verify_3caw.queue's (production settings: every guard at
# its module default, every test delay off, the clobber check on).
# NG0_NR1_HONOR alternates 0 (control) and 1 (fix).  The shape was seen once,
# in fw3c3 (1 of the 4 fw3c laps, 1 of 28 final-verification laps); its
# precursor is common: fw3c1-4 counted 47, 65, 95 and 119 no-inode releases
# that left a cached grant (hf7_left).
#
# READING RULES (written before the first lap):
#   NRESULT grades each lap (tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh, THE H-NR1 FIX).  A lap
#   with no marked recycle on any node (recycle_released_reset +
#   recycle_released_kept = 0) is NVACUOUS and counts for neither arm.
#   THE CONTROL SHOWS THE CAUSE when a control lap is NCONTROL-SHOWS-CAUSE:
#   logwr_relmark_regressed > 0, the clobber check finding a slot copied in
#   before a marked recycle written while the platter held a newer image (a
#   P-DINO-CLOBBER path=partial regress=1 on a slot a P-LOGWR-RELMARK-WRITTEN
#   line named, with that number's P-RECYCLE-RELEASED-KEEP before it on the
#   writer).
#   THE FIX IS SUPPORTED when, across the campaign, the control shows the
#   cause at least once, at least three fix laps are NPASS with
#   recycle_reset > 0, and no fix lap is NFAIL.
#   H-NR1 IS REFUTED by a fix lap with logwr_relmark_regressed > 0, by a fix
#   lap with a P-LOGWR-RELMARK-WRITTEN line reading staged=1 (prediction P2:
#   every logged slot copied in before the marked recycle is kept out), or by
#   a control-lap regression of shape (d) -- a partial-path P-DINO-CLOBBER
#   regress=1 on a slot whose in-core inode the writer recycled after a
#   P-NOINO-UNLOCK-LEFT-GRANT of that number -- with no
#   P-RECYCLE-RELEASED-KEEP of that number before it on the writer
#   (prediction P1).
#   Any other P-DINO-CLOBBER regress, node failure, CORRUPT shape, stall or
#   ABORT is attributed from its own lines to its own record; every other
#   *RESULT line is read as tests/queues/final_verify_3caw.queue reads it.
#
# Bound: the freed_nodelay laps' 1680 s per lap, as in
# tests/queues/final_verify_3caw.queue (fw3c1-4 ran 525-573 s).
1680 MXFS_SNAPSHOT_DIR=/mxfs/snapshots NG0_IWR_WHOLE=1 NG0_IWR_REFUSE=1 NG0_CR63_DEFER=1 NG0_IALLOC_FENCE=1 NG0_FENCE_HINT_EXEMPT=1 NG0_PEER_UNLINK=300 NG0_DRAIN_BOUND=0 NG0_PUBCLAIM_GUARD=1 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 NG0_IFREE_DRAIN=1 NG0_IFREE_REAP=1 NG0_RS1_SKIP=1 NG0_RECYCLE_SIDEREAD=1 NG0_UNLPREV_VERIFY=1 NG0_FREE_ADOPT_CORE=1 NG0_IFREE_EXTEND=1 NG0_CR63_IGRAB_RETRY=1 NG0_UB1_SKIP=1 NG0_NR1_HONOR=0 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh nra1 1 300 3/disk/caw/direct g3
1680 MXFS_SNAPSHOT_DIR=/mxfs/snapshots NG0_IWR_WHOLE=1 NG0_IWR_REFUSE=1 NG0_CR63_DEFER=1 NG0_IALLOC_FENCE=1 NG0_FENCE_HINT_EXEMPT=1 NG0_PEER_UNLINK=300 NG0_DRAIN_BOUND=0 NG0_PUBCLAIM_GUARD=1 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 NG0_IFREE_DRAIN=1 NG0_IFREE_REAP=1 NG0_RS1_SKIP=1 NG0_RECYCLE_SIDEREAD=1 NG0_UNLPREV_VERIFY=1 NG0_FREE_ADOPT_CORE=1 NG0_IFREE_EXTEND=1 NG0_CR63_IGRAB_RETRY=1 NG0_UB1_SKIP=1 NG0_NR1_HONOR=1 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh nra2 1 300 3/disk/caw/direct g3
